{"component":"site/sistema","html":"<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/images/logo_ab-96.webp\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/images/logo_os.png\"/><div class=\"ab-public-site ab-static-light min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 antialiased selection:bg-blue-100 selection:text-slate-900\"><a href=\"#conteudo\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-3 focus:left-3 focus:z-[60] focus:rounded-md focus:bg-white focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-sm focus:font-semibold focus:text-slate-900\">Pular para o conteúdo</a><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 border-b border-white/10 bg-brand-navy/95 text-white backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3\" aria-label=\"ABrasil Sistemas — início\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg\"><img src=\"/images/logo_ab-96.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></span><span class=\"leading-none\"><span class=\"block text-[15px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] text-white\">ABrasil</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 uppercase\">Sistemas</span></span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 lg:flex\" aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"radix-_R_19a_\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"dropdown-menu-trigger\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 transition outline-none hover:text-white data-[state=open]:text-white\">Soluções<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/sistemas\">Sistemas prontos</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/sobre\">Sobre</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/contato\">Contato</a></nav><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-5 lg:flex\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/login\">Entrar</a><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 transition hover:bg-slate-200\">Solicitar orçamento</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 lg:hidden\"><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Orçamento</a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Abrir menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu-movel\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-md border border-white/15\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"conteudo\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-brand-navy pt-28 pb-16 text-white sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcSet=\"/images/site/heroes/vetoros-640.avif 640w, /images/site/heroes/vetoros-1280.avif 1280w, /images/site/heroes/vetoros-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\"/><source type=\"image/webp\" srcSet=\"/images/site/heroes/vetoros-640.webp 640w, /images/site/heroes/vetoros-1280.webp 1280w, /images/site/heroes/vetoros-1920.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\"/><img src=\"/images/site/heroes/vetoros-1280.webp\" alt=\"Técnicos consertando equipamentos eletrônicos na bancada de uma assistência técnica\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"eager\" fetchPriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" style=\"object-position:45% 35%\"/></picture><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-navy/85 lg:bg-transparent lg:bg-linear-to-r lg:from-brand-navy lg:from-30% lg:via-brand-navy/85 lg:to-brand-navy/50\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-24 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-navy/80 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/sistemas\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left size-4\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg> Sistemas prontos</a><div class=\"mt-8 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/images/logo_os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" class=\"size-14 shrink-0 rounded-xl object-contain\"/><div class=\"grid gap-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-cyan\">Assistências técnicas</p><span class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800\">Disponível</span></div></div><h1 class=\"mt-6 text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl\">VetorOS<!-- -->:<!-- --> <!-- -->a operação da assistência técnica em um só sistema.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8\">Assistências técnicas costumam controlar ordens de serviço em cadernos, grupos de WhatsApp e planilhas. O resultado é cliente ligando para saber do aparelho, peça que some do estoque e caixa que não fecha.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition bg-white text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-200\">Solicitar demonstração<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://vetoros.com.br\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition border border-white/25 text-white hover:bg-white/10\">Criar conta e testar grátis</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#111a2e] shadow-2xl shadow-black/30 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2.5\"><span class=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 truncate rounded bg-white/5 px-3 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400\">VetorOS · painel</span></div><img src=\"/images/dashboard-vetoros.webp\" alt=\"Painel do VetorOS com prioridades do dia, clientes, ordens, agenda e mensagens\" width=\"1926\" height=\"934\" loading=\"lazy\" fetchPriority=\"auto\" class=\"block h-auto w-full\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Antes e depois</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">O que muda com o VetorOS.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Sem sistema</h3><ul class=\"mt-5 grid gap-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>Informações de clientes e equipamentos espalhadas</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>Clientes ligando o dia inteiro para saber o status</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>Estoque de peças sem controle real</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>Financeiro desconectado da operação</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/50 p-6 sm:p-8\"><h3 class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-brand-blue-hover uppercase\">Com o <!-- -->VetorOS</h3><ul class=\"mt-5 grid gap-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Histórico de cliente e equipamento em um só lugar</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Status da OS visível sem a equipe parar para responder</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Estoque com entrada, saída e alerta de reposição</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Financeiro conectado à operação</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Funcionalidades</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">O que o sistema faz.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-200 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Ordens de serviço e orçamentos</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Do recebimento do equipamento à entrega, com orçamento, aprovação, pagamentos e recibos.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Clientes e equipamentos</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Histórico completo de cada cliente e de cada aparelho atendido.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Portal do cliente</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">O cliente acompanha a ordem de serviço por um link, sem precisar ligar.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Follow-ups e cobranças</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Acompanhamento de orçamentos pendentes e de valores a receber.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Peças, estoque e vendas</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Entrada e saída de peças e produtos, vendas de balcão e controle de estoque.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Financeiro e indicadores</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Caixa, despesas, garantia, avaliações de clientes e painel com as prioridades do dia.</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-10 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Situação: <!-- -->Disponível<!-- -->.</strong> <!-- -->Em operação, com cadastro online aberto.</p><dl class=\"mt-6 grid gap-8 text-sm md:grid-cols-3\"><div><dt class=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Plataformas</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 leading-6 text-slate-600\">Web (computador, tablet e celular) · Portal do cliente por link</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Modelo de implantação</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 leading-6 text-slate-600\">SaaS na nuvem: cadastro online, sem instalação, com 14 dias de teste gratuito sem cartão de crédito.</dd></div><div><dt class=\"font-semibold text-slate-900\">Integrações</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 leading-6 text-slate-600\">Envio de e-mails com SMTP próprio da empresa · Atalho para os emissores fiscais oficiais</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Perguntas frequentes</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Sobre o VetorOS.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200\"><div data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_1ke_\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Preciso instalar alguma coisa?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform rotate-180\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"open\" id=\"radix-_R_1ke_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Não. O VetorOS funciona no navegador, em computador, tablet ou celular.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Como funciona o teste?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_2ke_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">O cadastro é feito online e libera 14 dias de acesso completo, sem pedir cartão de crédito.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Posso pedir uma demonstração?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_3ke_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Sim. Fale com a equipe e apresentamos o sistema com base na rotina da sua assistência.</div></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-8 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Precisa de algo além do <!-- -->VetorOS<!-- -->? Também fazemos<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-brand-blue underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"/desenvolvimento-de-sistemas\">sistemas sob medida</a> <!-- -->e<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-brand-blue underline underline-offset-4\" href=\"/integracao-de-sistemas-e-apis\">integrações com o que você já usa</a>.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"orcamento\" class=\"scroll-mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr] lg:gap-x-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Orçamento</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Veja o VetorOS na rotina da sua empresa.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-7 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8 text-slate-600\">Peça uma demonstração com a equipe ou crie sua conta no site do produto e teste por conta própria.</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-span-2 lg:row-start-1\"><form class=\"grid gap-5\" action=\"/contato\" method=\"post\"><noscript>O envio do formulário precisa de JavaScript. Se preferir, escreva para <!-- -->__AB_EMAIL__<!-- -->.</noscript><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"grid content-start gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_le_-contact_name\">Nome</label><input data-slot=\"input\" class=\"border-input file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-f